                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Overall, I'd advocate that we just need to start getting rid of no_content.  It's confusing for CLI users, and the benefits (of fewer bytes on the wire) seem to outweigh the positives (verbose descriptions and lots of clients that don't fully implement the specification)."
                },
